---
const nama = "Erlin Allesia Prawar";
const prodi = "Statistika";
const fakultas = "Fakultas Matematika dan Ilmu Pengetahuan Alam";
const kampus = "Universitas Cenderawasih";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Portofolio | Erlin Allesia Prawar</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      }

      body {
        background-color: #f0f9ff;
        color: #1e293b;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #38bdf8, #0284c7);
        color: #ffffff;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
      }

      .profile-img {
        width: 130px;
        height: 130px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        object-fit: cover;
        border: 4px solid #ffffff;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        background-color: #e0f2fe;
      }

      header h1 {
        font-size: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      }

      header p {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        opacity: 0.95;
      }

      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin-top: 0.8rem;
      }

      main {
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: -2rem auto 3rem;
        padding: 0 1.2rem;
      }

      .card {
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 1.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.08);
        border-top: 4px solid #38bdf8;
      }

      .card h2 {
        color: #0284c7;
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      .info-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .info-item {
        background-color: #f8fafc;
        padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;
      }

      .info-item span {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #64748b;
      }

      .info-item strong {
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: #0f172a;
      }

      .skills {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.6rem;
      }

      .skill-tag {
        background-color: #e0f2fe;
        color: #0369a1;
        padding: 0.45rem 0.95rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        color: #64748b;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      
      <h1>Erlin Allesia Prawar</h1>
      <p>Mahasiswa Program Studi Statistika</p>
      <span class="badge">Matematika dan Ilmu Pengetahuan Alam</span>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="card">
        <h2>Tentang Saya</h2>
        <p>
          Halo! Saya <strong>Erlin Allesia Prawar</strong>, mahasiswa aktif di
          <strong> Matematika dan Ilmu Pengetahuan Alam</strong> dengan program studi <strong>Statistika</strong>.
          Saya memiliki ketertarikan besar pada pengolahan data, analisis statistik,
          serta mengubah kumpulan data menjadi informasi yang bermanfaat.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>Identitas Akademik</h2>
        <div class="info-grid">
          <div class="info-item">
            <span>Nama Lengkap</span>
            <strong>Erlin Allesia Prawar</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <span>Program Studi</span>
            <strong>Statistika</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <span>Fakultas</span>
            <strong>Matematika dan Ilmu Pengetahuan Alam</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <span>Universitas</span>
            <strong> Universitas Cendrawasih</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>Minat & Keahlian</h2>
        <div class="skills">
          <span class="skill-tag">Analisis Data</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Statistika Dasar</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Visualisasi Data</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Microsoft Excel</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Pemrograman Dasar</span>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>&copy; 2026 Erlin Allesia Prawar — Portofolio Mahasiswa Statistika</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>